14. Conformance

An implementation conforms if it:

Preserves the canonical architecture.
Uses canonical interfaces.
Maintains deployment observability.
Supports operational governance.
Documents deployment topology and execution environments.
15. Future Evolution

Future revisions MAY introduce:

Autonomous deployment optimization.
Multi-cloud federation.
AI-assisted operations.
Self-healing infrastructure.
Dynamic workload placement.
Edge–cloud cognitive balancing.

Such extensions SHALL preserve the canonical deployment principles.